# 统一行尾策略：仓库内一律 LF，检出也是 LF。
# 这样不再依赖每台机器的 core.autocrlf（之前 git add 一直报 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"），
# 而且 CI 在 Linux 上构建——gradlew / *.sh 一旦带上 CRLF 会直接执行失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确二进制：这些格式本身是 zip / 位图，被当文本做换行转换会直接损坏文件
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.ppt binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
